            <div xml:id="d379-a1">

                <pb facs="0543" n="447" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg447"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 114.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">japanese silk regulations.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Official Gazette of the 29th contains the following notifications:</p>
                <p>We hereby give sanction to the provisions regarding the inspection as well as the
                    classification of raw silk, and the amount of encouragement funds to he granted,
                    in accordance with law No. 49, issued in the 30th year of Meiji, embodying the
                    regulations for the encouragement of the direct export of silk, and direct the
                    same to be promulgated.</p>
                <p>(Imperial sign manual and great seal.)</p>
                <p>March 26, of the 31st year of Meiji.</p>
                <p>(Countersigned)</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Count Inouye Kaoru</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Minister of Finance</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Baron Ito Miyoji</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Minister of Agriculture and
                                Commerce.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
